WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:07.080
Ohio State University offers a course called
“Sports for the Spectator.”.

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:11.660
Students are taught how to be “an informed
and appreciative sports spectator.”

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:23.320
70% of all train journeys in England start
or finish in London.

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:28.769
Swinging your arms when walking makes it 12%
easier.

00:00:28.769 --> 00:00:35.489
Travelling at normal speed, it takes a fully
loaded supertanker 20 minutes to stop.

00:00:35.489 --> 00:00:40.120
They usually cut their engines 15 miles away
from the dock.

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:45.149
Research shows that plants grow better when
they're stroked.

00:00:45.149 --> 00:00:52.730
The record number of live goldfish swallowed
at a single sitting is 210.

00:00:52.730 --> 00:00:57.960
Frank Sinatra took a shower 12 times a day.

00:00:57.960 --> 00:01:03.120
Before the invention of electricity, human
beings slept for 90 minutes longer than they

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:05.620
do now.

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:14.729
The fastest swallow in nature is that of the
frogfish, which sucks its prey down in 0.006

00:01:14.729 --> 00:01:17.130
seconds.

00:01:17.130 --> 00:01:23.840
At it's peak Blockbuster Video earned nearly
$800 million through late fees alone, making

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:27.710
up 16% of its revenue.

00:01:27.710 --> 00:01:31.640
The first baseball caps were made of straw.

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:38.320
The ancient Egyptians mummified beef ribs,
sliced duck and goat meat to eat in the afterlife.

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:46.510
Mozart's sister was also a musician, who sometimes
took top billing as they toured Europe together.

00:01:46.510 --> 00:01:50.280
The most leaves ever found on a clover is
12.

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:58.220
Statically, too much homework can cause depression
and lower grades.

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:03.799
Getting angry at people when listening to
them breathing or eating is an actual neurological

00:02:03.799 --> 00:02:16.480
disorder called Misophonia.

